# Compacted carbonate sediment thickness (m) - pale variant.
# Derived from carbonate_thickness_blue_orange_red.cpt: CIE LCh chroma reduced
# to 0.45x with lightness remapped L -> 55 + 0.42*L, then the violet low end
# (bands 0-25 m) rotated to a true-blue hue ramp (272 -> 256 deg) and lightened
# so it does not dominate the warm end. Class boundaries are unchanged, so this
# is the same ramp at much lower saturation. NaN = 189/189/189, the continent
# grey used by the figure and video scripts. Generated 2026-07-28.
